{"id":"sturm","lemma":"Sturm","pos":"noun","rank":1677,"glosses":["A strong, blustery wind; gust; gale; squall","storm, tempest","storm, rush, attack"],"ipa":"/ʃtʊrm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/84/De-Sturm.ogg/De-Sturm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Sturmes","plural":"Stürme"},"formAudio":{"Sturmes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sturmes.wav","Stürme":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-St%C3%BCrme.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie lange wird der Sturm anhalten?","en":"How long will the storm last?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593071","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to stop"}]},{"text":"Ein Sturm zieht auf.","en":"A storm is coming.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/395036","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"},{"g":"on"}]},{"text":"Nach dem Sturm war es ruhig.","en":"After the storm, it was calm.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"quietly"}]},{"text":"Ich habe den Sturm über geschlafen.","en":"I slept through the storm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760986","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"schlafen"}]},{"text":"Das war die Ruhe vor dem Sturm.","en":"It was the calm before the storm.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"calm"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]}]}